## Ship blockers (must fix or explicitly accept before marketing trustless claims)

- [ ] **C-01** Operator-chosen `purchaseWithSeed` seed — grindable stock picks (`AssetManager`)
- [ ] **H-01** Permissionless `PrevRandaoCoordinator.fulfill` — outcome shopping / producer bias
- [ ] **H-02** Multi-leg swap `amountOutMinimum = 0` for legs 1..n-1
- [ ] **H-03** Listing lock docs-only — `transferFrom` / `claim` / `earlyExit` bypass soft flag
- [ ] **H-04** `$SHRH` dual check flash-loanable at deposit + reveal snapshots
- [ ] **H-05** No full-principal cancel when funding goal unmet after deadline
- [ ] **H-06** Direction v2 post-close / post-reveal exit windows not implemented (docs mismatch)
- [ ] **H-07** Last earlyExit → `participantCount == 0` bricks `close()` (`Pot: empty`)
- [ ] **H-08** API `immutable` Cache-Control after reveal freezes pre-claim metadata

## Invariants (must always hold)

- [x] Σ card.ownershipWeight for a pot == 1e18 after reveal (enforced in `RevealEngine._allocate`; fuzz exists; **not** in invariant suite)
- [x] Every revealed card has ownershipWeight > 0 (floor repair to 1; dust DoS edge untested)
- [ ] pot.totalDeposited + entryFees == USDG held until purchase pull (**breaks under FoT** — nominal accounting)
- [ ] After purchase: feesOwed == protocolFee + entryFees; sweep once only
- [ ] After all claims: assetsClaimed + dust on pot == assetAmount
- [x] Card can be claimed at most once; only by NFT owner; only when Revealed
- [ ] Σ deposits == totalDeposited across earlyExit (invariant suite deposit-only today)

## Access control

- [x] Only factory pots can mint cards
- [x] Only revealer can reveal; only pot can markClaimed
- [x] Only assetManager can pullForPurchase / markPurchased
- [x] purchasePulled prevents double pull
- [ ] pause on factory blocks deposits/claims — **also freezes earlyExit**; matrix untested

